syphon provides CMake targets:

    find_package(unofficial-syphon CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE unofficial::syphon::syphon)

Headers are reached through the framework:

    #import <Syphon/SyphonMetalServer.h>

Syphon.framework is installed under lib/ and is loaded by its bundle-relative
install name, so a binary built against the target finds it where vcpkg put
it. An application that ships copies the framework into its own bundle and
adds the loader path for it.
